Frontend: React Native (Expo) with Tailwind CSS (NativeWind) for iOS, Android, and Web.

Backend: Node.js (TypeScript) or Go running REST/GraphQL and WebSocket connections for real-time messaging.

Database & Geospatial: PostgreSQL with PostGIS extension for geo-fenced spatial searches.

Vector Search Engine: Qdrant or Pinecone for AI-assisted product-to-capability matching.

Mutual Credit Engine: Immutable double-entry ledger database (event-sourced).
